Xymon theme packages
====================

Each immediate subdirectory is one theme package:

  theme-id/theme.conf       Presentation variables activated by xymon-theme
  theme-id/static/          Files published below menu/themes/theme-id
  theme-id/templates/       Optional files installed below web/themes/theme-id

classic-blue is the default theme and uses Xymon's existing blue menu.
classic-grey selects the existing grey menu. The default needs no generated
drop-in; disabling an active theme returns to classic-blue.

Theme identifiers must begin with an ASCII letter or digit and may contain
only letters, digits, dots, underscores, and hyphens. A manifest may set only
the presentation variables accepted by xymon-theme. Theme packages must use
unique paths and must not replace stock configuration, assets, or templates.
